{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "b9ed1a33f6a939be2b4110a5b9d74b0e4fe6a1c91e05f21655115716a2070cf5", "ja": "ハジけろ、夏の乙女たち", "zh": "尽情释放吧，夏日少女们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1bbb9087921a77554860a1e2f28fe82ed6e1e783674f63aadeaea4ef858ecd38", "ja": "全国ツアープロジェクト『ミリオンシアター\nシーズン』。ダイヤチームの一員として、南\nエリアに向かう、莉緒、雪歩、琴葉、真美。\nハジけた失恋曲を歌うには、ハジける練習が\n必要と、一同は海に合宿にやってきた。", "zh": "全国巡演企划《Million Theater\nSeason》。作为钻石队的一员，莉绪、雪步、琴叶、真美前往南部\n地区。\n要演唱充满活力的失恋歌曲，就需要进行尽情释放的练习，于是大家来到海边集训。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ac435cdbf051882e70758e9e0dedcd243175571f1246c5952c5cb7ce5f2079f0", "ja": "はーーーーじーーーーけーーーーろーーーー！", "zh": "尽ーーーー情ーーーー绽ーーーー放ーーーー吧ーーーー！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "ac435cdbf051882e70758e9e0dedcd243175571f1246c5952c5cb7ce5f2079f0", "ja": "はーーーーじーーーーけーーーーろーーーー！", "zh": "尽ーーーー情ーーーー绽ーーーー放ーーーー吧ーーーー！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "42335fe7d7d366a889bdcd4886b80e8eee73315a9cd1d773ffea3c5bd2122872", "ja": "も～、ふたりとも！\nそんなんじゃ、全然ハジけてないよー！", "zh": "真是的～，你们两个！\n这样根本就还没嗨起来嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "6bb6725784ae82523ad3ef481071ef73cba65a0b6c4826424aa070c781b2d23e", "ja": "もっと激しく、大胆に！　せーの！", "zh": "更加激烈，更加大胆！预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ac435cdbf051882e70758e9e0dedcd243175571f1246c5952c5cb7ce5f2079f0", "ja": "はーーーーじーーーーけーーーーろーーーー！", "zh": "尽ーーーー情ーーーー绽ーーーー放ーーーー吧ーーーー！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "ac435cdbf051882e70758e9e0dedcd243175571f1246c5952c5cb7ce5f2079f0", "ja": "はーーーーじーーーーけーーーーろーーーー！", "zh": "尽ーーーー情ーーーー绽ーーーー放ーーーー吧ーーーー！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d0308ed31e15eb578782890da723ef86786af67ec0ea827d533884ad54725767", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。\nも、もしかして、注目されちゃってる……？", "zh": "哈、哈……  \n难、难道已经被大家注意到了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "ce6b32e85e4dfe57b0eb8fad27b4b43eeded658420976a136beae179b0f1e4bd", "ja": "ゆきぴょん、そんなの気にしちゃダメダメ！\nシューギインを捨てて、もう1回！", "zh": "雪步步，可不能在意那种事啦！\n抛开“羞议院”，再来1次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "bb73ee2ba6df9d93d8a1207aded0b3bcbd0914ad543e52d41f4ff58fa784c870", "ja": "シューギイン……もしかして、羞恥心のこと？\nあっ、なんでもない！", "zh": "“羞耻心”……难道说的是这个？\n啊，没什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f634de641095bd80380513ab410e22d9828ee8a78841c3224b319f3dd35b451c", "ja": "は、はーーーーじーーーーけーーーーろーーーーっ！", "zh": "爆、爆——发——吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "89df9d573a1da97f9f90bf8824b96b756a13d93af96edc82607034872b1f8b67", "ja": "雪歩ちゃん……！　わ、私も！", "zh": "雪步……！我、我也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "730e6da61337b14f602b7b30ac671d363de51bb7259ecade9720b3e76672cb4c", "ja": "はーーーーじーーーーけーーーーろーーーーっ！", "zh": "尽情爆发吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a0bd93634b27288e545e89fab55274f90936c0610b4d9f6f658ec7e165b88d3b", "ja": "（ダイヤチームによる、南エリアを巡るツアー。本番を\n控え、チームが一丸となってレッスンに励む中……）", "zh": "（钻石队巡游南部区域的巡演。在正式演出前，队员们齐心协力地投入练习，而……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "990a1bc4c44a85d9215702db946faf21aad44692f76b9ab3d26cee9460ef8feb", "ja": "（新曲『真夏のダイヤ☆』を歌う事になったメンバーと\n何故か、二泊三日の海合宿をする事になった！）", "zh": "（要和演唱新歌《盛夏的钻石☆》的成员们一起，不知为何参加为期三天两夜的海边集训了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b6b7f1e6a2779959d6f5439b9f3c362dc7664a5f3af119c837ed350073dc0a14", "ja": "ええと……一体、何が起こっているんだ？\nそろそろ、誰かに説明して欲しいんだけど。", "zh": "呃……这到底是怎么回事？\n差不多该有人给我解释一下了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "8862a6a5c4a9fcf306fba23651282fdca281714dc98fb39f1bf611ff7f1aac5c", "ja": "ふふっ。それについては、私から説明させてもらうわ！", "zh": "呵呵。关于这件事，就由我来向你说明吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5c1c1420216288bb468a2ad9c06d91bb45881063ceefbd51c480f1692b69bba7", "ja": "あっ、莉緒！", "zh": "啊，莉绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "ab7d5c6a15358a71a97d2f5c44f52a1dee1fb55a7bf410e2082983896cacf2d8", "ja": "いい？　今、ふたりがやっているのは……\nハジける練習なのよ！", "zh": "听好了？我们现在两个人正在进行的，是……\n尽情释放活力的练习哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "44f03f7cab84f9e8636e9d4ec55ef220129d089e8f813765800605388a8bd037", "ja": "ハジける練習……というと？", "zh": "所谓绽放练习……是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "f0530b54a46601d0165208d65ca8eb35be50e6e866d95c98c14a67a6240e54cc", "ja": "全国ツアーに向けて、{$P$}くんが\n私たちに新曲を聞かせてくれたじゃない？", "zh": "为了准备全国巡演，{$P$}先生不是让我们听过新歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "025893909d0409b2e8b5168a8da5ccb6456c63deb0b230cbaaaf08a2b82ce184", "ja": "正直、また失恋の曲かあ……って思ったけど、今までと\n違うアプローチで、いい曲だと思ったわ。でもね……。", "zh": "说实话，我本来还想着“又是失恋题材的歌啊……”不过这首歌采用了和之前不同的处理方式，我觉得是首不错的歌。但是呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "3a9c6bbc6355dda31298900e4a3a287fea589ac4ec31402206769ca182d0dfc9", "ja": "琴葉お姉ちゃんとゆきぴょん、明るい曲調で失恋を\n歌うのが、どうしてもイメージできないんだって～。", "zh": "琴叶姐姐和雪步喵说，她们怎么都想象不出用明快的曲调来唱失恋呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "720b66e00030ed26c2003dc9008651e5d9b4b8d0d14403533604c6aacaa8e7be", "ja": "まあ、失恋だからな……。\nどうしてもネガティブなイメージはあるだろうけど。", "zh": "也是，毕竟是失恋啊……\n难免会让人觉得很消极就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "2600c72cc7dde700fc7ed76956b3489a9feba6097727e8a13b5e9b72141f0e73", "ja": "でも、そこから前を向くための曲でしょ？\n私はオトナの女だし、その辺の機微もわかるけど……。", "zh": "但是，这是首让人从失恋中重新振作起来的歌吧？\n我也是成熟的大人了，这点微妙之处还是懂的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "2a5f8d46a5c3cc815406c07e1d86c45f071d22cc93e7910480914782698fedcb", "ja": "とりあえずふたりには、失恋から立ち直るために、\nハジけることを学んでほしい……そう思ったの！", "zh": "总之，我希望她们两个能学会尽情释放自己，好从失恋中走出来……我是这么想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5d9a8ae9023bd62eb406a76a48dd766665b9861f68f298e08aa4ba4c5e501c46", "ja": "そ、そうか。一応、経緯は理解したよ。\n海で叫ぶ＝ハジけた事になるかは、疑問だけど……。", "zh": "是、是吗？总之事情的经过我明白了。\n不过，在海边大喊大叫就算是放飞自我吗……我对此表示怀疑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "70010aa5773d6a967b059ed99243524207c830d6bfea35fc19583bdc8788daf8", "ja": "ええっ！？　でもでも、歌詞にもあったよ！？\nハジけるために三泊四日女子旅行、って！", "zh": "诶诶！？可是可是，歌词里也写了呀！？\n为了尽情释放自我，来一场四天三夜的女子旅行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "8b2a51d96404d035d214d49942cb5525214279a8f15695e62778ac67963d071f", "ja": "真美とりおっち、新曲にリアリティを出すために\n一生懸命考えたんだよ！　それなのに兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "为了让新歌更有真实感，真美和莉绪可是费尽心思想过了！可哥哥你却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "d81df6e1f1730bc11f38a5c3a8300f8b2ac9eea91bb15c125d6c7c0544532333", "ja": "そうよ！　それに、何事も体験してみるのが一番！\nみんなで旅行に来たのも、その一環だもの♪", "zh": "没错！而且，无论什么事，亲身体验一下才是最重要的！大家一起来旅行，也是体验的一环嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "3da093d3f41970723af6b17962c3cc38d674b6590d1b3028c336c8d15f410638", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nけど……肝心の雪歩と琴葉はどうなんだ？", "zh": "是、是吗。可是……关键是雪步和琴叶怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "903235805f6dba5b48bc243dafa2d97aafdf049dd24be774f1bc3ae15cb93286", "ja": "私……やってみたいです。失恋って、\nすごく悲しいことだと思うけど……。", "zh": "我……想试试看。失恋是很悲伤的事，我觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "af2bda11f9ea060a4a5b830400683c792d6368ac2fadc7dfb65daedb7cc0c9fe", "ja": "それを吹き飛ばせるような歌が歌えるのは、\nすごいことなんじゃないかと思って。", "zh": "我觉得，能唱出将那种悲伤一扫而空的歌曲，是一件很了不起的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1032_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0248642e57e6fc479d1b5183b7b2944894a918b673be6e355447de59b3021bb2", "ja": "わ、私からもお願いします！　失恋したのに\nハジけるなんて、私にはない発想だから……。", "zh": "我、我也拜托您了！明明失恋了\n却还能嗨起来，这种想法我根本想不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1033_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bae1f5d06fca6ab2f5caecc1068cd948d4f357c992379767ba8c37e143ddefc1", "ja": "私なんかでも、前向きになれるなら……\nが、がんばりたいですぅ！", "zh": "要是连我这样的人也能变得积极起来……我、我也想努力试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_01_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "6a1a669ee74c0cf6b4a58fb7442a161ed17f1f1ab8f011670445625cd7949a45", "ja": "ふたりもこう言っていることだし。この旅行で、\nハジける女の子の気持ち、絶対マスターするのよ！", "zh": "既然你们两位都这么说了。这次旅行中，我一定要彻底掌握那种活泼女孩的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
